msgstr "本局对局中与引擎交换的每一行：\n{}"

msgid "Every line exchanged with the engines, in logs/ in the tournament folder, opened from the Games tab. Always kept for the games lost on time, by a crash, a stall or an illegal move."
msgstr "与引擎交换的每一行，保存在锦标赛文件夹的 logs/ 中，可从“对局”页打开。超时判负、崩溃、无响应或非法着法而输掉的对局总会保留。"

msgid "Every move gets this time, whatever was used before (go movetime)."
msgstr "每步都给予这么多时间，不管之前用了多少（go movetime）。"

msgid "Every move is searched to this depth (go depth), however long it takes: no time loss."
msgstr "每步都搜索到此深度（go depth），无论耗时多久：不会超时判负。"

